# The ruined metropolis close up: its most characteristic floor from above and
# over the shoulder at noon, and turned.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_metro_close.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_ruined_metropolis
wait 3.0
shot metro-above with land:ruined_metropolis
zoom 40
wait 1.0
shot metro-wide with land:ruined_metropolis
zoom 15
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot metro-noon with land:ruined_metropolis
mouse 900,0 0.8
wait 1.0
shot metro-turned with land:ruined_metropolis
near ruin
wait 2.0
shot metro-stump
mouse 900,0 0.8
wait 1.0
shot metro-stump-turned
